{"nodes": [{"id": "mock_mock_system", "label": "Dev-only Mock System", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/mock.md", "source_location": "L1-L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fake data served by Nitro only in development: to work on a page before its endpoint exists and to reproduce on demand states the database lacks (empty list, 500, slow response)."}, {"id": "mock_define_ts", "label": "server/mocks/define.ts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/mock.md", "source_location": "L14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mock_definemock", "label": "defineMock()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/mock.md", "source_location": "L14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Identity function existing only for contract checking and autocompletion inside the object literal."}, {"id": "mock_registry_index_ts", "label": "server/mocks/index.ts (mock registry)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/mock.md", "source_location": "L15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Registry stays explicit: import.meta.glob is a Vite feature unavailable in Nitro/rollup, and the list is the single place showing which mocks exist; a forgotten file never answers by mistake."}, {"id": "mock_servemock", "label": "serveMock(event)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/mock.md", "source_location": "L15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mock_entity_mock_files", "label": "server/mocks/*.mock.ts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/mock.md", "source_location": "L16", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Data generated at module level with a fixed faker seed so ids survive restarts and detail lookups match list resul